    "detailed_description": "<h1>CHECK OUT MY OTHER GAMES!</h1><p><br><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Corduroy Hollow\u00ae is a first-person survival horror game. Play as Ashley as she explores the depths of a creepy decrepit house in the middle of the woods. Combat possessed children's toys, solve puzzles, and evade the ever-lurking Corduroy demon, while seeking your way out. You never know who or what is going to be around the next corner in this dilapidated house of shadows and corduroy.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> First-person survival horror<br></li><li> Wander the old decrepit house in the woods using agility, stealth and strategy to avoid the possessed children's toys<br></li><li> Earn powerful new abilities to help you in your escape.<br></li><li> Solve environmental puzzles, ally with friendly stuffed animal characters, and elude the horror of the Corduroy Demon<br></li><li> Discover the terrifying secrets of the creepy, desecrated grounds of Corduroy Hollow\u00ae</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1582320/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.poster.avif?t=1752353113\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1582320/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.webm?t=1752353113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1582320/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.mp4?t=1752353113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
